INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(3901,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5408573','2013 update of the 2011 American College of Rheumatology recommendations for the treatment of juvenile idiopathic arthritis: recommendations for the medical therapy of children with systemic juvenile idiopathic arthritis and tuberculosis screening among children receiving biologic medications.','Ringold S, Weiss PF, Beukelman T, Dewitt EM, Ilowite NT, Kimura Y, Laxer RM, Lovell DJ, Nigrovic PA, Robinson AB, Vehe RK; American College of Rheumatology.','2013','quotidian evanescent hepatomegaly serositis organomegaly cytopenias hyperferritinemia hypertriglyceridemia hypofibrinogenemia cep tfp pfw unconflicted cep finalizing tfp cep tfp tfp tfp voter tfp tfp tfp nonbiologic nonbiologic nonbiologic pfw cep rilonacept tfp tfp pfw tfp tfp tfp pfw cep cep cep teleconferences cep cep cep voter evanescent hepatomegaly serositis tfp tfp quotidian cytopenias hypertriglyceridemia hypofibrinogenemia hemophagocytosis transaminitis organomegaly hyperferritinemia tfp tfp tuberculin cep tfp tfp tfp voter cep tfp tfp nonbiologic tfp tfp permutations tfp tfp tfp tfp tfp voter intraarticular alphabetically tfp tfp alphabetically intraarticular alphabetically nonbiologic rilonacept rilonacept tfp alphabetically intraarticular intraarticular intraarticular tfp alphabetically intraarticular intraarticular alphabetically nonbio rilonacept alphabetically tfp alphabetically rilonacept culmination cep cep anajis anajis tfp calcineu rin tfp ctps ctps ctps culmination appendix1 nihms853939 supp_appendix1 appendix2 nihms853939 supp_appendix2 regina rasheed aminoff danielle colleen correll hobday janow mannion theresa muskardin dax rumsey yonit sterba alysha taxter ringold k12hs019482 musculo ar059749 beukelman mckesson ilowite laxer nigrovic ringold beukelman dewitt ilowite yukiko laxer nigrovic ringold byun vehe pamela mara colbert delgaizo pavla dolezalova polly feudtner sheila passo sampath prahalad marilynn pun