s using a case-crossover design. Injury Prevention. 2013 doi: 10.1136/injuryprev-2012-040561. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 37. Lusk AC, Furth PG, Morency P, Miranda-Moreno LF, Willett WC, Dennerlein JT. Risk of injury for bicycling on cycle tracks versus in the street. Injury Prevention. 2011;17(2):131–135. doi: 10.1136/ip.2010.028696. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 38. Morency P, Gauvin L, Plante C, Fournier M, Morency C. Neighborhood social inequalities in road traffic injuries: the influence of traffic volume and road design. American Journal of Public Health. 2012;102(6):1112–1119. doi: 10.2105/AJPH.2011.300528. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ]',103,'2025-10-15 09:12:24','2025-10-15 09:12:24');
